@page "/"

<PageTitle>Smart-X · Overview</PageTitle>

<div class="page-header">
    <h1>Smart-X Ecosystem</h1>
    <p>
        Core data ingestion engine. Three architectural pillars make up the
        full platform; Part 1 of this PoE implements the first.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="pillar-grid">
    <div class="pillar enabled">
        <span class="pillar-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M3 13h4l2-7 4 14 2-7h6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="pillar-index">PILLAR 01</span>
        <span class="pillar-title">Sensor Data Ingestion &amp; Telemetry</span>
        <p class="pillar-desc">
            Register devices, validate their deployment hierarchy, attach
            config/log files, and watch live readings with anomaly and
            disconnect highlighting.
        </p>
        <span class="pillar-state live"><span class="pip"></span> Active</span>
        <a class="pillar-cta" href="telemetry">Open dashboard &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="pillar enabled">
        <span class="pillar-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="14" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/>
                <path d="M7 9l3 3-3 3M12 15h5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="pillar-index">PILLAR 02</span>
        <span class="pillar-title">Real-Time Command Stream &amp; History</span>
        <p class="pillar-desc">
            Issue manual override commands to deployed devices, search and
            filter by category or alert state, and get automated suggested
            actions based on historical patterns.
        </p>
        <span class="pillar-state live"><span class="pip"></span> Active</span>
        <a class="pillar-cta" href="commands">Open command stream &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="pillar disabled">
        <span class="pillar-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2.3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/>
                <circle cx="5" cy="18" r="2.3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/>
                <circle cx="19" cy="18" r="2.3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/>
                <path d="M10.5 6.6L6.7 16M13.5 6.6L17.3 16M7.3 18h9.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="pillar-index">PILLAR 03</span>
        <span class="pillar-title">Network Topology &amp; Mesh Routing</span>
        <p class="pillar-desc">
            Visualise the device mesh and manage routing between facilities,
            zones and nodes.
        </p>
        <span class="pillar-state locked"><span class="pip"></span> Final PoE</span>
    </div>
</div>
